Third-party data
----------------

The files in `data/preprocessed/` are derived from the Lending Club loan data
(accepted loans 2007-2018Q4) as distributed on Kaggle:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/wordsforthewise/lending-club
which is released on Kaggle under CC0: Public Domain
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

These files remain subject to the license and terms of use of the original
dataset and are NOT relicensed under CC BY 4.0 by the authors of this
repository. The synthetic datasets in `data/synthetic/` were generated by a
model trained on this data; users should also comply with the original
dataset's terms when using them.

The macroeconomic features `unemployment_rate` and `federal_funds_rate` were
obtained from FRED (Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis):
https://fred.stlouisfed.org/
